<title>DENMARK: Tele Danmark in interconnect deals.</title>
<headline>Tele Danmark in interconnect deals.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish telecommunications group Tele Danmark said on Thursday it signed two new interconnect deals with French-German-U.S. Global One Communications and Denmark's Cybercity.</p>
<p>The announcement came in a statement sent to Copenhagen Stock Exchange.</p>
